sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner
    participant Engine
    participant Store
    participant Runner
    participant Worker
    participant Evaluator
    Owner->>Engine: Approve frozen protocol
    Engine->>Store: Recheck and reserve for queued attempt
    Store-->>Engine: Commit reservation and attempt
    Engine->>Store: Commit lease and fence
    Engine->>Runner: Dispatch reviewed attempt under lease
    Runner->>Worker: Start with approved manifest
    Worker-->>Runner: Predictions and bounded result envelope
    Runner->>Evaluator: Validated bytes and identity
    Evaluator-->>Engine: Trusted metrics and outcome
    Engine->>Store: Fence, commit outcome and settle
